{"scenes":[{"id":"sun-yat-sen","title":"孙中山故居 · 翠亨寻迹","intro":"从赭红色的故居走进岭南青砖巷陌，在纪念馆、老民居与旧村塾之间，认识孙中山的故乡。九处实景，串起翠亨的一段近代记忆。","spots":[{"id":"sun-residence","name":"孙中山故居","description":"赭红拱廊与岭南居家格局相遇，是这趟翠亨之行的起点。","guide":"眼前这座两层楼房建于1892年，由孙眉汇款资助、孙中山设计并主持修建。它朝向西面，外观吸收西式建筑元素，内部保留本地住宅的格局。可以先观察拱廊和门窗，再看庭院与室内的关系。1912年5月，孙中山卸任临时大总统后曾回乡在这里小住。","factSource":"https://sunyat-sen.org/portal/article/index.html?cid=85&id=27746","photo":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/sun-residence/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:20250904 Former residence of Sun Yat-sen.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/20250904_Former_residence_of_Sun_Yat-sen.jpg/1280px-20250904_Former_residence_of_Sun_Yat-sen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/20250904_Former_residence_of_Sun_Yat-sen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250904_Former_residence_of_Sun_Yat-sen.jpg","width":4096,"height":3072,"artist":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","date":"2025-09-04 14:50:08","description":"Former residence of Sun Yat-sen","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/sun-residence.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}},{"id":"memorial-museum","name":"孙中山纪念馆","description":"在故居西北侧，沿展览认识孙中山的一生与家庭。","guide":"这座纪念馆与故居主楼是两处不同的建筑。纪念馆在1999年开放，2025年5月完成提升后重新迎接观众。馆内常设内容围绕孙中山的生平、亲属与后裔展开。看过故居的日常生活空间，再进入展厅阅读照片、文献和实物，能把个人经历与时代背景联系起来。","factSource":"https://sunyat-sen.org/portal/article/index.html?cid=85&id=27745","photo":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/memorial-museum/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:Memorial Museum of Sun Yat-sen, Zhongshan.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Memorial_Museum_of_Sun_Yat-sen%2C_Zhongshan.jpg/1280px-Memorial_Museum_of_Sun_Yat-sen%2C_Zhongshan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/Memorial_Museum_of_Sun_Yat-sen%2C_Zhongshan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Memorial_Museum_of_Sun_Yat-sen,_Zhongshan.jpg","width":3264,"height":1836,"artist":"Solatido","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","date":"2024-03-31 15:42:40","description":"Memorial Museum of Sun Yat-sen, Zhongshan","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/memorial-museum.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}},{"id":"folk-houses","name":"翠亨民居展示区","description":"沿青砖小巷，看翠亨不同家庭的生活陈设与民俗。","guide":"这里以村落民居为线索，展示翠亨的日常生活与地方习俗。官方陈列包括侨眷家庭、中等农家、木匠作坊、杂货店等内容。放慢脚步，看看巷道、门窗和厅堂的尺度，再比较不同家庭的家具与器物。这片生活背景，让故居里的人物故事多了一层乡土温度。","factSource":"https://sunyat-sen.org/portal/list/index.html?id=101","photo":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/folk-houses/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:ZS 中山 Zhongshan 翠亨村民區展覽 Cuiheng Village Folk House Exhibition May 2023 Px3 13.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/ZS_%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1_Zhongshan_%E7%BF%A0%E4%BA%A8%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%8D%80%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Cuiheng_Village_Folk_House_Exhibition_May_2023_Px3_13.jpg/1280px-ZS_%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1_Zhongshan_%E7%BF%A0%E4%BA%A8%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%8D%80%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Cuiheng_Village_Folk_House_Exhibition_May_2023_Px3_13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/ZS_%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1_Zhongshan_%E7%BF%A0%E4%BA%A8%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%8D%80%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Cuiheng_Village_Folk_House_Exhibition_May_2023_Px3_13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ZS_%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1_Zhongshan_%E7%BF%A0%E4%BA%A8%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%8D%80%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Cuiheng_Village_Folk_House_Exhibition_May_2023_Px3_13.jpg","width":3000,"height":4000,"artist":"Shuma Shuam CHENMIEL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","date":"2023-05-30 16:49:02","description":"ZS 中山 Zhongshan 翠亨村民區展覽 Cuiheng Village Folk House Exhibition in May 2023","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/folk-houses.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}},{"id":"yang-yin","name":"杨殷故居","description":"青砖、木雕与百叶窗，保存着杨殷的家庭记忆。","guide":"杨殷故居又称杨翰香堂，大约建于1888年前后。它采用岭南常见的三间两廊格局，青砖外墙与木构空间中，也能看到百叶窗和带西式趣味的装饰。室内以复原陈列和纪念展览介绍杨殷的生活与经历。游览时可以留意檐下雕饰及窗头的岭南水果纹样。","factSource":"https://www.sunyat-sen.org/portal/article/index.html?cid=146&id=25949","photo":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/yang-yin/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:20250904 Former residence of Yang Yin.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/20250904_Former_residence_of_Yang_Yin.jpg/1280px-20250904_Former_residence_of_Yang_Yin.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/20250904_Former_residence_of_Yang_Yin.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250904_Former_residence_of_Yang_Yin.jpg","width":4096,"height":3072,"artist":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","date":"2025-09-04 15:17:35","description":"Former residence of Yang Yin","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/yang-yin.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}},{"id":"lu-haodong","name":"陆皓东故居","description":"一座带庭院的朴素民居，讲述陆皓东的青少年生活。","guide":"陆皓东青少年时期曾在这座房子里生活。故居建于清代晚期，朝东开门，以三间两廊组成日常起居空间，门前还有种植岭南花木的庭院。比起故居主楼的赭红拱廊，这里的建筑风格更朴素。馆内纪念展览介绍陆皓东的经历，可与孙中山故居和冯氏宗祠连起来参观。","factSource":"https://www.sunyat-sen.org/portal/article/index.html?cid=146&id=25950","photo":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/lu-haodong/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:20250904 Former residence of Lu Haodong.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/20250904_Former_residence_of_Lu_Haodong.jpg/1280px-20250904_Former_residence_of_Lu_Haodong.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/20250904_Former_residence_of_Lu_Haodong.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250904_Former_residence_of_Lu_Haodong.jpg","width":4096,"height":3072,"artist":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","date":"2025-09-04 15:33:16","description":"Former residence of Lu Haodong","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/lu-haodong.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}},{"id":"feng-ancestral-hall","name":"冯氏宗祠","description":"由家族祠堂兼作村塾，是孙中山早年读书的地方。","guide":"这座小祠堂曾经承担过村塾的角色。根据纪念馆资料，孙中山在1875年至1878年间曾在这里启蒙读书，并与陆皓东等同学结交。建筑采用三间两廊格局，把祭祀、家族与乡村教育的历史联系在一起。来到这里，可以想一想一个岭南村落中的孩子如何开始认识更大的世界。","factSource":"https://www.sunyat-sen.org/portal/article/index.html?cid=147&id=25954","photo":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/feng-ancestral-hall/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:20250904 Fengshi Zongci.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/20250904_Fengshi_Zongci.jpg/1280px-20250904_Fengshi_Zongci.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/20250904_Fengshi_Zongci.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250904_Fengshi_Zongci.jpg","width":4096,"height":3072,"artist":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","date":"2025-09-04 16:42:55","description":"Feng Clan Ancestral Hall","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/feng-ancestral-hall.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}},{"id":"zhenyi-hall","name":"杨贞义堂","description":"又称朝议第，灰塑、青砖与天井展现岭南大宅之美。","guide":"杨贞义堂也叫朝议第，建于清代中后期，是翠亨传统大宅的代表。它沿中轴组织多进院落，门框、青砖墙和檐下装饰各有细节。天井让光线进入屋内，木窗与庭院花木又为深宅增添生活气息。观看时可把它与周边较小的民居比较，感受不同家庭的空间安排。","factSource":"https://www.sunyat-sen.org/portal/article/index.html?cid=147&id=25952","photo":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/zhenyi-hall/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:20250904 Zhenyi Tang.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/20250904_Zhenyi_Tang.jpg/1280px-20250904_Zhenyi_Tang.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/20250904_Zhenyi_Tang.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250904_Zhenyi_Tang.jpg","width":4096,"height":3072,"artist":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","date":"2025-09-04 16:58:54","description":"Zhenyi Hall","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/zhenyi-hall.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}},{"id":"warning-bell","name":"警世钟","description":"树荫下的一口大钟，以铭文寄托纪念与自省。","guide":"警世钟是一处可以停下来细读文字的纪念设施。钟身一面刻有孙中山手迹，另一面收录他在1924年勉励国民的演讲内容。它借钟声唤醒人的意象，表达对孙中山的纪念。欣赏时可以绕着钟身看看文字与结构；是否允许敲钟，请遵守现场管理提示。","factSource":"https://sunyat-sen.org/portal/article/index.html?cid=85&id=27740","photo":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/warning-bell/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:孙中山故居警世钟.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/%E5%AD%99%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E8%AD%A6%E4%B8%96%E9%92%9F.jpg/1280px-%E5%AD%99%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E8%AD%A6%E4%B8%96%E9%92%9F.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/%E5%AD%99%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E8%AD%A6%E4%B8%96%E9%92%9F.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AD%99%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E8%AD%A6%E4%B8%96%E9%92%9F.jpg","width":3800,"height":2928,"artist":"EditQ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","date":"2023-02-28","description":"​孙中山故居警世钟","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/warning-bell.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}},{"id":"conference-hall","name":"孙中山演讲厅","description":"园区中的公共文化活动空间，外有供人停留的广场。","guide":"这里是园区的演讲厅与公共文化活动空间。纪念馆公开的活动记录中，演讲厅旁广场曾承接展览与节日活动。走到这里，可以看看建筑入口和周边绿荫，也为这趟参观稍作停留。这里并不表示孙中山本人曾在这座现有建筑里演讲；室内是否开放及活动安排，请以现场公告为准。","factSource":"https://www.sunyat-sen.org/portal/article/index.html?cid=7&id=66334","photo":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/conference-hall/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:Conference Hall, Sun Yat-sen Memorial Museum, Zhongshan.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Conference_Hall%2C_Sun_Yat-sen_Memorial_Museum%2C_Zhongshan.jpg/1280px-Conference_Hall%2C_Sun_Yat-sen_Memorial_Museum%2C_Zhongshan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/Conference_Hall%2C_Sun_Yat-sen_Memorial_Museum%2C_Zhongshan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Conference_Hall,_Sun_Yat-sen_Memorial_Museum,_Zhongshan.jpg","width":3264,"height":2448,"artist":"Solatido","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","date":"2024-03-31 15:09:10","description":"Conference Hall, Sun Yat-sen  Memorial Museum, Zhongshan","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/conference-hall.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}}]},{"id":"qijiang-park","title":"岐江公园 · 船厂记忆","intro":"沿岐江走进旧粤中船厂：看草地上的旧船、伸向远处的铁轨、透光的船坞构架，以及被玻璃包裹的水塔。七处风景，串起一段工业与江岸的新生活。","spots":[{"id":"old-ship","name":"船厂旧船","description":"旧船停在草地上，留下船厂与岐江相依的记忆。","guide":"先看船身的轮廓，再留意甲板、舷窗与周围的树影。这里原是粤中造船厂，船厂创办于1953年，1999年停产，随后改建为公园。旧船成为认识这段生产历史的入口。它如今是一件供人观看的工业遗存；具体船名与建造年份尚未找到可靠资料，因此不作推断。","factSource":"https://www.turenscape.com/project/detail/4983.html","photo":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/old-ship/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:Qijiang Park.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Qijiang_Park.jpg/1280px-Qijiang_Park.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qijiang_Park.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","artist":"EditQ","date":"2023-02-28","description":"船厂旧船 · Wikimedia Commons","path":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/old-ship/photos/photo-01.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-23","changes":"缩放至 1280px 宽；页面缩略图按容器裁切。"}},{"id":"railway-columns","name":"铁轨与白色柱阵","description":"沿旧轨道看向白色钢柱，工业的直线变成林间风景。","guide":"两根铁轨把视线引向远处，两侧竖立的白色钢柱则把目光带向天空。轨道、碎石和野草保留了工业场地的质感，柱阵为这段路增添了新的节奏。可以从轨道一端看整体，再走到侧面观察柱子与树木的层次。这里适合慢慢观看，请走正常步道，不在轨道上攀爬或追逐。","factSource":"https://zsrbapp.zsnews.cn/mobile/news/viewNews/548077","photo":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/railway-columns/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:Qijiang Park 1.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Qijiang_Park_1.jpg/1280px-Qijiang_Park_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qijiang_Park_1.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","artist":"EditQ","date":"2023-02-28","description":"铁轨与白色柱阵 · Wikimedia Commons","path":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/railway-columns/photos/photo-01.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-23","changes":"缩放至 1280px 宽；页面缩略图按容器裁切。"}},{"id":"dock-frame","name":"船坞遗构","description":"裸露的屋架与新钢构相遇，让人看见建筑的骨架。","guide":"抬头看，一排排三角屋架把原有厂房的轮廓留在空中。设计资料记载，公园保留了旧造船车间的部分框架，再加入新的钢结构与公共空间。眼前白色构架、深色钢柱和树木交错，正好能观察新旧材料的区别。具体经营用途与可进入区域以现场为准。","factSource":"https://www.turenscape.com/paper/detail/124.html","photo":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/dock-frame/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:Qijiang Park 3.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Qijiang_Park_3.jpg/1280px-Qijiang_Park_3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qijiang_Park_3.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","artist":"EditQ","date":"2023-02-28","description":"船坞遗构 · Wikimedia Commons","path":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/dock-frame/photos/photo-01.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-23","changes":"缩放至 1280px 宽；页面缩略图按容器裁切。"}},{"id":"art-museum","name":"中山美术馆","description":"柠檬黄墙面与铁青色屋架，为旧厂区添上明亮色彩。","guide":"这座美术馆于2002年11月6日开放，由俞孔坚设计改造。先从外面看建筑：黄色墙面、深色钢架和大幅玻璃并置，屋顶保留着工业建筑般鲜明的节奏。它把展览、收藏与公共教育带进公园。馆内展览会更换，是否开放及入馆要求请查看当日公告。","factSource":"https://www.zs.gov.cn/zswgxj/gkmlpt/content/2/2366/post_2366927.html","photo":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/art-museum/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:中山美术馆.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E7%BE%8E%E6%9C%AF%E9%A6%86.jpg/1280px-%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E7%BE%8E%E6%9C%AF%E9%A6%86.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E7%BE%8E%E6%9C%AF%E9%A6%86.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","artist":"EditQ","date":"2023-02-28","description":"中山美术馆 · Wikimedia Commons","path":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/art-museum/photos/photo-01.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-23","changes":"缩放至 1280px 宽；页面缩略图按容器裁切。"}},{"id":"amber-tower","name":"琥珀水塔","description":"玻璃与金属外罩包住旧水塔，像为时间留下一枚琥珀。","guide":"透过玻璃外罩，可以辨认内部旧水塔的轮廓。设计者把新外壳与旧混凝土结构放在一起，以“琥珀”比喻对时间的保存。观看时不妨比较两层结构的材料和尺度，再看看水面的倒影。这座保留旧塔本体的装置，与园内重新制作的骨骼水塔有所不同。","factSource":"https://www.turenscape.com/paper/detail/124.html","photo":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/amber-tower/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:Qijiang Park 9.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Qijiang_Park_9.jpg/1280px-Qijiang_Park_9.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qijiang_Park_9.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","artist":"EditQ","date":"2023-02-28","description":"琥珀水塔 · Wikimedia Commons","path":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/amber-tower/photos/photo-01.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-23","changes":"缩放至 1280px 宽；页面缩略图按容器裁切。"}},{"id":"waterfront-bridge","name":"水岸钢桥","description":"从钢桥看水面、树冠与厂区构架，体会公园的工业线条。","guide":"桥把分开的水岸连在一起，也提供了一段观看公园的好视线。留意栏杆、支撑和桥面的直线，它们与厂房钢架、轨道共同构成这里的工业语言。设计团队把简洁直接的路径作为公园的一部分。过桥时可以放慢脚步看看两岸，拍照请给其他行人留出通道。","factSource":"https://www.turenscape.com/project/detail/4983.html","photo":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/waterfront-bridge/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:岐江公园 1.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/%E5%B2%90%E6%B1%9F%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD_1.jpg/1280px-%E5%B2%90%E6%B1%9F%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B2%90%E6%B1%9F%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD_1.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","artist":"EditQ","date":"2023-02-28","description":"水岸钢桥 · Wikimedia Commons","path":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/waterfront-bridge/photos/photo-01.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-23","changes":"缩放至 1280px 宽；页面缩略图按容器裁切。"}},{"id":"waterside-walk","name":"滨水步道","description":"在水面、草木与栏杆之间，看看船厂留下的另一种日常。","guide":"沿步道望去，水面把树木、旧设施与今天的城市放在同一幅画面里。公园改造重视原有植物和水岸环境，使工业遗存与日常散步空间相伴。这里不必急着寻找下一个地标，可以观察水边植物与岸线的层次。水边湿滑，通行请以现场围栏和标识为准。","factSource":"https://www.turenscape.com/project/detail/4983.html","photo":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/waterside-walk/photos/photo-01.jpg","credit":{"title":"File:岐江公园 4.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/%E5%B2%90%E6%B1%9F%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD_4.jpg/1280px-%E5%B2%90%E6%B1%9F%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD_4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B2%90%E6%B1%9F%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD_4.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","artist":"EditQ","date":"2023-02-28","description":"滨水步道 · Wikimedia Commons","path":"/assets/scenics/qijiang-park/spots/waterside-walk/photos/photo-01.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-23","changes":"缩放至 1280px 宽；页面缩略图按容器裁切。"}}]}]}